{"cursor":[29,4],"rows":["  3"," 28 <p align=\"center\">>Alacritty - A fast, cross-platform, OpenGL terminal emulator</h1>"," 27                                                                                                                                       y","  6 <p align=\"center\">"," 26 </p>mg alt=\"Alacritty - A fast, cross-platform, OpenGL terminal emulator\""," 25        src=\"extra/promo/alacritty-readme.png\">"," 24 <h1 align=\"center\">"," 23"," 22 <p align=\"center\">"," 21"," 20 Alacritty is a modern terminal emulator that comes with sensible defaults, but"," 19 </p>ws for extensive [configuration](#configuration). By integrating with other"," 18 applications, rather than reimplementing their functionality, it manages to"," 17 provide a flexible set of [features](./docs/features.md) with high performance."," 16 The supported platforms currently consist of BSD, Linux, macOS and Windows."," 15"," 14 The software is considered to be at a **beta** level of readiness; there are"," 13 a few missing features and bugs to be fixed, but it is already used by many as"," 12 a daily driver."," 11"," 10 Precompiled binaries are available from the [GitHub releases page](https://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/releases).","  9","  8 Join [`#alacritty`] on libera.chat if you have questions or looking for a quick help.","  7","  6 [`#alacritty`]: https://web.libera.chat/gamja/?channels=#alacritty","  5","  4 ## Features","  3","  2 You can find an overview over the features available in Alacritty [here](./docs/features.md).","  1 [`#alacritty`]","  1 ## Further information","  2","  3 - [Announcing Alacritty, a GPU-Accelerated Terminal Emulator](https://jwilm.io/blog/announcing-alacritty/) January 6, 2017","  4 - [A talk about Alacritty at the Rust Meetup January 2017](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qHOdYO3WUTk) January 19, 2017","  5 - [Alacritty Lands Scrollback, Publishes Benchmarks](https://jwilm.io/blog/alacritty-lands-scrollback/) September 17, 2018","  6","  7 ## Installation","  8","  9 Alacritty can be installed by using various package managers on Linux, BSD,"," 10 macOS and Windows."," 11"," 12 Prebuilt binaries for macOS and Windows can also be downloaded from the"," 13 [GitHub releases page](https://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/releases)."," 14"," 26 For everyone else, the detailed instructions to install Alacritty can be found                            markdown  523 word   8/113 1"],"history":[],"attrs":[[0,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[1,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[1,4,5,"i1","d",""],[1,5,6,"i4","d","b"],[1,6,7,"i1","d",""],[1,7,12,"i6","d",""],[1,12,13,"i1","d",""],[1,13,21,"i3","d",""],[1,21,23,"i1","d",""],[1,23,32,"i15","d","bu"],[1,32,83,"i15","d","b"],[1,83,85,"i6","d",""],[1,85,87,"i4","d","b"],[1,87,88,"i6","d",""],[2,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[2,138,139,"i3","d",""],[2,139,140,"i7","i0",""],[3,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[3,4,5,"i1","d",""],[3,5,6,"i4","d","b"],[3,6,7,"i1","d",""],[3,7,12,"i6","d",""],[3,12,13,"i1","d",""],[3,13,21,"i3","d",""],[3,21,22,"i1","d",""],[4,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[4,4,6,"i6","d",""],[4,6,7,"i4","d","b"],[4,7,8,"i6","d",""],[4,8,10,"i4","d","b"],[4,10,11,"i1","d",""],[4,11,14,"i6","d",""],[4,14,15,"i1","d",""],[4,15,77,"i3","d",""],[5,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[5,4,11,"i1","d",""],[5,11,14,"i6","d",""],[5,14,15,"i1","d",""],[5,15,49,"i3","d",""],[5,49,50,"i1","d",""],[6,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[6,4,5,"i1","d",""],[6,5,7,"i4","d","b"],[6,7,8,"i1","d",""],[6,8,13,"i6","d",""],[6,13,14,"i1","d",""],[6,14,22,"i3","d",""],[6,22,23,"i1","d",""],[7,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[8,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[8,4,5,"i1","d",""],[8,5,6,"i4","d","b"],[8,6,7,"i1","d",""],[8,7,12,"i6","d",""],[8,12,13,"i1","d",""],[8,13,21,"i3","d",""],[8,21,22,"i1","d",""],[9,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[10,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[10,4,13,"i15","d","u"],[10,13,82,"i15","d",""],[11,0,4,"i7","i0",""],[11,4,6,"i6","d",""],[11,6,7,"i4","d","b"],[11,7,8,"i6","d",""],[11,8,26,"i15","d",""],[11,26,39,"i6","d","u"],[11,39,41,"i15","d",""],[11,41,55,"i3","d",""],[11,55,83,"i15","d",""],[12,0,4,"i7","